Aim:
To study and execute basic networking commands.

Algorithm:
1. Open the command prompt.
2. Enter the required networking command.
3. Observe the output.
4. Verify network information.
Commands:
Command	Purpose
ipconfig	Displays IP configuration
ping google.com	Checks connectivity
ipconfig /all	Displays detailed network information
nslookup google.com	Finds DNS information
tracert google.com	Displays network route
hostname	Displays system hostname
arp -a	Displays ARP table
netstat -an	Displays network connections
